1513r.jpg"}, {"id": 1914328, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1513s.jpg"}], "slug": "bugs-and-birdies", "storyline": "You wash up on a small island with nothing but the Origin Block. By day the islands are peaceful and full of things waiting to be found; by night the beetles come, and that is when you find out how well you built. Summon and defeat the Beetle King to open the gate to magic \u2013 mana, wands and potions \u2013 and an island world that is far from done showing you everything.", "summary": "A cozy survival sandbox with teeth \u2013 alone or in online co-op for up to four players. You wash up on a small island in a wide pixel sea with nothing but the Origin Block. Explore a world of pixel islands, gather and craft, build your farmstead and raise an army of hens, fish from every shore and trade with the frogs. By night the beetle swarms come: hold the fences with turrets, swords and wands. Beneath the islands wait dungeons of many kinds, a labyrinth, a Lucky Hall, the Kraken and the Beetle King. Free updates keep the island world growing.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/bugs-and-birdies", "videos": [{"id": 197336, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "F0dQyol_F20", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F0dQyol_F20", "title": "Bugs & Birdies \u2013 Official Trailer | Free Demo October 16 on Steam", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/F0dQyol_F20/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}